  89:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *            intended mainly for internal use. Be careful when using this 
  90:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *            function, as divisor and result width are dependent
  91:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *            on MTDIV_WIDTH_xx setting. By calling this function you get
  92:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *            either quotient or modulo, depending on div parameter.
  93:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *
  94:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *  \param    dividend:  the dividend
  95:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *  \param    divisor:   the divider
  96:common/prog/math/mathDiv.h ****  *
